      <activity id="82d87926-5f65-5cbc-8bd2-29bfbd52e4d8" activityNameId="dfec3369-e57f-5fb4-9520-5c6a535468fd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Auxiliary heating, electric, 5kW, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Auxiliary heating, electric, 5kW, at plant
Heating with 5kW capacity which can be used as auxiliary heating for hot water in solar collector systems.;
UUID: a9f215f6-6bad-3e8e-93ac-26944a76b67a
Production and disposal of an electric heating. Including materials and energy use of production. Not including infrastructure for factory.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Auxiliary heating used to provide additional heat in a solar collector system.
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Material uses for a heating with 25kW capacity can be estimated to be three times higher than for the 5kW heating.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a9f215f6-6bad-3e8e-93ac-26944a76b67a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
